{"ID":"20240504170625-thh3bz4","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504170625-thh3bz4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504170625-thh3bz4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624092911-590b1w0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611123207-kdyt9o0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624094038-rdmt0j9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:28,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:28\u0026#125;","title":"152殷孽","type":"doc","updated":"20240813134901"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240731192133-dfybty8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731192133-dfybty8","updated":"20240813134848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 706px;","style":"width: 696px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石钟乳"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石钟乳-20240813134543-lsx4ipr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 696px;\" parent-style=\"width: 706px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731192133-ovcii6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731192133-ovcii6r","updated":"20240731192133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 709px;","style":"width: 699px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"钟乳"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/钟乳-20240731192048-l83fhim.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 699px;\" parent-style=\"width: 709px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624092911-590b1w0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624092911-590b1w0","updated":"20240813134854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石钟乳 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石钟乳 1-20240813134648-k7mp13u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813134855-5toztkb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813134855-5toztkb","updated":"20240813134901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石钟乳 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石钟乳 2-20240813134751-tsflvsc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624094038-rdmt0j9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624094038-rdmt0j9","updated":"20240624094726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：钟乳石中，根部为殷孽，中间部位为孔公孽，尖端部分才是钟乳石。李时珍记载，附石而生，粗者为殷孽，接殷孽而生以渐空通者为孔公孽，接孔公孽而生者为钟乳。盖殷孽如人之乳根，孔公孽如乳房，钟乳如乳头也。"}]},{"ID":"20240624094038-pxu5bv0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624094038-pxu5bv0","updated":"20240624094038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：实际上真正的钟乳石里面是都有孔的，孔里面往下滴下的液体是含有碳酸钙的水，含有碳酸钙的水滴在地上久而久之就会形成石笋。这个含碳酸钙的水滴在石笋上溅出来落在岩石壁上或岩石底下，就会形成石花。"}]},{"ID":"20240611123142-til94w1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611123142-til94w1"}},{"ID":"20240611123143-2lv4gd9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611123143-2lv4gd9","updated":"20240611123153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"殷孽《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611123143-3qdxe6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123143-3qdxe6b","updated":"20240611123143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒。主治脚冷疼弱。钟乳根也。生赵国，又梁山及南海，采无时。（恶术、防己。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611123143-2wdobf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123143-2wdobf0","updated":"20240611123143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文：殷孽，味辛，温。主烂伤瘀血，泄利寒热，鼠瘘症瘕结气。一名姜石。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611123119-9quxez2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611123119-9quxez2"}},{"ID":"20240611123129-wo4h9d5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611123129-wo4h9d5","updated":"20240611123135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"殷孽《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611123129-3u5xu7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123129-3u5xu7u","updated":"20240611123129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主烂伤瘀血，泻痢，寒热鼠 ，症瘕结气，脚冷疼弱。一名姜石，钟乳根也。生赵国山谷，又梁山及南海，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611123119-0k3xx1w","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611123119-0k3xx1w"}},{"ID":"20240611123120-2u7385l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611123120-2u7385l","updated":"20240611123124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"殷孽《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240611123120-yz1mvr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123120-yz1mvr3","updated":"20240611123120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即钟乳根，盘结如姜。味辛，温，无毒。主烂伤瘀血，泄痢寒热、鼠 、 瘕结气、脚冷疼弱，下乳汁。恶防己，畏术。"}]},{"ID":"20240611123054-onk9nf0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611123054-onk9nf0"}},{"ID":"20240611123107-p1c27zn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611123107-p1c27zn","updated":"20240611123112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"殷孽《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240611123107-ihv8gt4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123107-ihv8gt4","updated":"20240611123107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主治烂伤，瘀血，泄痢，寒热，鼠 ，症瘕，结气，脚冷疼弱。一名姜石，钟乳根也。生赵国山谷，又梁山及南海，采无时。（恶术、防己。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611123107-nb8myyk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123107-nb8myyk","updated":"20240611123107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赵国属冀州，此即今人所呼孔公孽，大如牛羊角，长一、二尺左右，亦出始兴。"}]},{"ID":"20240611123054-xanhxp0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611123054-xanhxp0"}},{"ID":"20240611123056-azmith0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611123056-azmith0","updated":"20240611123100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"殷孽《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240611123056-tnjf2ik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123056-tnjf2ik","updated":"20240611123056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。主烂伤瘀血。泄利。寒热。鼠。症瘕结气。一名姜石。生山谷。仰漱飞根。潜萌隐孽。指列姜蟠。脉通乳结。床设桷。花霏霜雪。土脂凝。清凉散热。"}]},{"ID":"20240611123056-z686o7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123056-z686o7v","updated":"20240611123056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"名医曰。殷孽钟乳根也。云笈七签。仰餐飞根。李时珍曰。殷隐也。生于石上。隐然如木之孽。又如生姜。新芽顿长。若列指状。苏恭曰。根蟠结如姜。吕氏春秋。血脉欲其流通也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611123056-e4918hg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123056-e4918hg","updated":"20240611123056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"韩愈文。大者为。细者为桷。苏恭曰。石床钟乳。水滴下凝积如笋状。久渐与上乳相接为柱。石花乳水滴石上。散如霜雪。皆与殷孽同功。土殷孽服之亦同钟乳。而不发热。名医曰。"}]},{"ID":"20240611123056-gl541p6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123056-gl541p6","updated":"20240611123056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生高山土之阴。色白如脂。唐明皇序。尝散热之馔。"}]},{"ID":"20240611123026-8tvy5jm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611123026-8tvy5jm"}},{"ID":"20240611123030-r5iov3i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611123030-r5iov3i","updated":"20240611123037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"殷孽《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611123030-mbhheh7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123030-mbhheh7","updated":"20240611123030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主烂伤瘀血，泄痢，寒热，鼠 ，症瘕结气，脚冷疼弱。一名姜石，钟乳根也。生赵国山谷，又梁山及南海。采无时。（恶防己，畏术。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611123030-y6ygl9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123030-y6ygl9e","updated":"20240611123030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶赵国属冀州，此即今人所呼孔公孽，大如牛、羊角，长一、二尺左右，亦出始兴。唐本注云∶此即石堂下孔公孽根也。盘结如姜，故名姜石。俗人乃以孔公孽，为之误尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240611123030-tosn41f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123030-tosn41f","updated":"20240611123030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"臣禹锡等谨按日华子云∶殷孽，治筋骨弱，并痔 等疾及下乳汁。"}]},{"ID":"20240611123030-wgk06g2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123030-wgk06g2","updated":"20240611123030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经文具石钟乳条下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611123031-pj8kyy8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611123031-pj8kyy8"}},{"ID":"20240611123205-8jxh93x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611123205-8jxh93x","updated":"20240611123216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"殷孽《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611123205-wxpqsyc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123205-wxpqsyc","updated":"20240611123205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、温、无毒。主烂伤瘀血，泄痢，寒热，鼠 ，症瘕，结气。脚冷疼弱。一名姜石，钟乳根也。生赵国山谷，又梁山及南海，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611123205-1x3y8ze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123205-1x3y8ze","updated":"20240611123205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恶术、防己。赵国属冀州，此即今人所呼孔公孽，大如牛羊角，长一、二尺左右，亦出始兴。"}]},{"ID":"20240611123205-9f4ef68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123205-9f4ef68","updated":"20240611123205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此即石堂下孔公孽根也，盘结如姜，故名姜石。俗人乃以孔公孽为之，误矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611123206-q68w1ys","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611123206-q68w1ys"}},{"ID":"20240611123207-kdyt9o0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611123207-kdyt9o0"}}]}